readme.text:
- a turn that answered is a solid dot;
- **a turn that stopped before it answered is a red dot**, not a blue one — blue
  means "answering right now";
- a turn still being written is blue.

Every part of this repository was produced by an AI assistant in response to a
user's request:

- `lib/index.js`, `lib/client.js` — implementation, including all comments;
- `icon.svg` — the four-pointed star;
- `locale/en.json`, `locale/zh.json` — plugin listing text;
- `cordis.patch.yml`, `package.json` — the bundle wiring;
- `README.md`, `README.en.md` — the Chinese document and this English version.
